<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which one meets with</i> or
				<i>finds</i>: hence, 
			<i>booty, prey, spoil</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ.
			γίγνομαι</span>, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράσι δυσμενέεσσιν ἕλωρ καὶ κύρμα
					γένησθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.488
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυσὶ κύρμα γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.272
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰωνοῖσιν ἕλωρ καὶ κ. γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.271
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.473
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώκῃσι καὶ ἰχθύσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.480
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a person,
				<i>one who gets booty, swindler</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				431
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
